direction_514 = location "Lamia" about "Lamia\nMust feed on fresh human blood; attacks all warriors in its vicinity" found "Karus" at 1409 987 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, Linnart Village is recruiting knights due to heightened monster attacks. I think you should go talk to [Sentinel] Hashan."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Nice to meet you. I am Hashan, in charge of village security. I've heard so much about you. Meeting you in person like this finally affords hope to our village."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "The monster attacks have jumped markedly and the resulting damage dire. At this rate, it's just a matter of time till our village disappears. Please save our village."

On in_progress
    Say "Hope the village will regain peace soon..."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_514

On ready
    Say "Thank you. It seems the road to knighthood is extremely demanding."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you very much. I'm so glad we have a knight like you in our village."
